        "headline": "Hydrologic Outlook issued August 26 at 3:50PM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK",
        "description": "ESFAFC\n\nLocations:\n\n* Yentna and Skwentna River basins\n* Rivers, creeks, and streams with headwaters along the western\nTalkeetna Mountains, including Moose Creek near Oilwell Road\n\nTiming:\n\n* Thursday evening through Saturday Evening. Heaviest rain Thursday\nnight through Friday morning.\n\nRainfall:\n\n* Widespread rainfall of 0.5 to 1.5 inches of rain is likely (60-70%)\nacross the Susitna Valley late Thursday Night through Saturday\nevening. Highest rain amounts will likely be in Susitna Valley\nnort",
